        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人间清醒从懂人性开始</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  body {\n    background-color: #f0eee9;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .container {\n    max-width: 560px;\n    width: 100%;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .header-top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .knowledge-cards {\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-right: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    background-color: #000;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 3px 12px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .main-title {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .subtitle-box {\n    background-color: #000;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 12px 24px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .content-box {\n    border: 2.5px solid #3b4a5a;\n    background-color: #f0eee9;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .section {\n    border-bottom: 2.5px solid #3b4a5a;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .section:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  \n  /* Section 1 */\n  .sec1 {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .sec1-left {\n    width: 110px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-right: 2.5px solid #3b4a5a;\n    padding: 20px 10px;\n    background-color: #e8e9e9;\n  }\n  .sec1-right {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .sec1-title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .sec1-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .sec1-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #555;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 2 */\n  .sec2 {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .sec2-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .sec2-col:first-child {\n    border-right: 2.5px solid #3b4a5a;\n  }\n  .sec2-title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .sec2-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .sec2-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #555;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 3 */\n  .sec3-title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .sec3-title-pill {\n    background-color: #3b4a5a;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .sec3-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #555;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 4 */\n  .sec4-title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .sec4-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .sec4-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .sec4-text:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  \n  .placeholder {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #dcdcdc;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header-top\">\n      <div class=\"knowledge-cards\">Knowledge Cards</div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">TONG 知识分享</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <h1 class=\"main-title\">人间清醒从懂人性开始</h1>\n    \n    <div class=\"subtitle-box\">每天一遍停止内耗，停止emo</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-box\">\n      <!-- Section 1 -->\n      <div class=\"section sec1\">\n        <div class=\"sec1-left\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">[Icon: Note]</div>\n          <div style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 2px;\">从众</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec1-right\">\n          <div class=\"sec1-title-row\">\n            <div class=\"sec1-title\">随大溜会让人变得平庸吗</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;\">[Icon: Bulb]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sec1-text\">\n            社会心理学关于从众的定义是，由于群体的压力而改变个体自己的行为或信念。正向，在安静的地方，会不自觉压低讲话的声音；相反，新店开业请一些托儿来排队，制造门庭若市的假象，产生好奇跟着去抢。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Section 2 -->\n      <div class=\"section sec2\">\n        <div class=\"sec2-col\">\n          <div class=\"sec2-title-row\">\n            <div class=\"sec2-title\">积极的从众心态</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;\">[Icon: Smile]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sec2-text\">\n            有助于学习他人的智慧和经验，修正自己盲目自信的缺点，完善思考方式，扩大视野。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec2-col\">\n          <div class=\"sec2-title-row\">\n            <div class=\"sec2-title\">消极的从众心态</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;\">[Icon: Sad]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sec2-text\">\n            会扼杀个人的独立意识和判断力，束缚思想，使人墨守成规，没有主见，甚至陷入骗局。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Section 3 -->\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"sec3-title-row\">\n          <div class=\"sec3-title-pill\">从众≠丧失独立思考能力</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 26px;\">[Icon: List]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec3-text\">\n          人被外界的信息影响几乎是件不可避免的事情，对多数人来说，从众是一种自我保护和低成本、高效率的决策方式。问题不在于从众，而在于看清自己的真实需求。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Section 4 -->\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"sec4-title-row\">\n          <div class=\"sec4-title\">影响个体从众的因素</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;\">[Icon: Target]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec4-text\">\n          1. 规范影响来自人们希望获得别人的接纳；我们希望得到别人的喜欢。公开反应时从众度较高，这反映了规范影响的力量。其实不光是人类，动物界，甚至整个生物界也有明显的从众特质。和大多数一样更安全，这几乎成为刻在基因里的认知。\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sec4-text\">\n          2. 信息影响来自他人提供的事实证据。遇到困难的决策任务时从众度也较高，这反映了信息影响的力量，我们希望能正确行事。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
